{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain pattern: chat ingress, retrieval over policies, guarded generation that refuses when ungrounded, and HR escalation."}
{"t":"assume","id":"chat-channel","text":"DingTalk or Lark via AgentCore IM connector","alt":"Web chat via custom Function Compute webhook"}
{"t":"assume","id":"policy-store","text":"Company policies stored in OSS and indexed in DashVector","alt":"Policies stored directly in Tablestore Knowledge Storage"}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many employee policy questions do you expect per day?"}
{"t":"ask","id":"success","text":"What outcome means success, and what is today's baseline for HR escalations?"}
{"t":"step","id":"chat-in","kind":"trigger","label":"Employee chat message","product":"agentcore","runs":"customer","untrusted":true,"why":"Entry point for employee questions from the configured IM channel"}
{"t":"step","id":"input-guard","kind":"guard","label":"Screen inbound message","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Block prompt injection and harmful content before retrieval"}
{"t":"step","id":"embed-query","kind":"knowledge","label":"Embed employee query","task":"retrieve","product":"dashvector","ai":"text-embedding-v4","runs":"fc","effect":"read","why":"Convert question to vector for semantic search over policies"}
{"t":"step","id":"search-policies","kind":"knowledge","label":"Search policy documents","task":"retrieve","product":"dashvector","runs":"fc","effect":"read","private":true,"why":"Find relevant company policy chunks"}
{"t":"step","id":"rank-policies","kind":"knowledge","label":"Rank policy results","task":"rerank","ai":"qwen3-rerank","runs":"fc","why":"Re-rank retrieved chunks to surface the most relevant evidence"}
{"t":"step","id":"answer-policy","kind":"ai","label":"Generate grounded answer","task":"generate","ai":"qwen3.7-plus","runs":"fc","why":"Answer using only retrieved policies; refuse if evidence is insufficient"}
{"t":"step","id":"decide-route","kind":"decide","label":"Route by confidence","task":"check","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","why":"Classify whether the answer is grounded, needs refusal, or requires HR escalation"}
{"t":"step","id":"output-guard","kind":"guard","label":"Screen outbound reply","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Prevent private data leaks and harmful content in the final reply"}
{"t":"step","id":"send-reply","kind":"act","label":"Deliver answer to employee","effect":"reply","product":"agentcore","runs":"customer","why":"Send the approved response back through the chat channel"}
{"t":"step","id":"hr-handoff","kind":"human","label":"HR agent takes over","task":"takeover","runs":"customer","why":"Escalate unknown or sensitive questions to a live HR representative"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-answered","kind":"end","label":"Question answered","runs":"customer","why":"Successful completion path"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-refused","kind":"end","label":"Refused no grounding","runs":"customer","why":"Completion path when the bot correctly refused to hallucinate"}
{"t":"step","id":"end-escalated","kind":"end","label":"Escalated to HR","runs":"customer","why":"Completion path after human takeover"}
{"t":"link","id":"chat-to-guard","from":"chat-in","to":"input-guard","kind":"next","label":"New message received"}
{"t":"link","id":"guard-to-embed","from":"input-guard","to":"embed-query","kind":"next","label":"Message passed safety check"}
{"t":"link","id":"embed-to-search","from":"embed-query","to":"search-policies","kind":"next","label":"Query embedded"}
{"t":"link","id":"search-to-rank","from":"search-policies","to":"rank-policies","kind":"next","label":"Candidates found"}
{"t":"link","id":"rank-to-answer","from":"rank-policies","to":"answer-policy","kind":"next","label":"Evidence ranked"}
{"t":"link","id":"answer-to-decide","from":"answer-policy","to":"decide-route","kind":"next","label":"Draft ready"}
{"t":"link","id":"route-send","from":"decide-route","to":"output-guard","kind":"branch","label":"Grounded answer available"}
{"t":"link","id":"route-refuse","from":"decide-route","to":"end-refused","kind":"branch","label":"No grounding found, refuse"}
{"t":"link","id":"route-escalate","from":"decide-route","to":"hr-handoff","kind":"escalate","label":"Unknown or sensitive question"}
{"t":"link","id":"guard-to-send","from":"output-guard","to":"send-reply","kind":"next","label":"Reply passed safety check"}
{"t":"link","id":"send-to-end","from":"send-reply","to":"end-answered","kind":"next","label":"Reply delivered"}
{"t":"link","id":"hr-to-end","from":"hr-handoff","to":"end-escalated","kind":"next","label":"HR took over conversation"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Policy chatbot prompt chain with DashVector RAG, grounded generation with refusal, output guard, and HR escalation via AgentCore."}

{"t":"say","text":"Router pattern: classify tickets, retrieve KB, sandbox remediation, then human approval before any production write."}
{"t":"assume","id":"ticket-src","text":"Tickets arrive via webhook from an ITSM tool like Jira or ServiceNow"}
{"t":"assume","id":"kb-store","text":"Knowledge base is indexed in DashVector for semantic retrieval"}
{"t":"step","id":"in","kind":"trigger","label":"Receive support ticket","product":"eventbridge","runs":"fc","untrusted":true,"why":"Entry point for inbound IT support requests"}
{"t":"step","id":"guard","kind":"guard","label":"Screen ticket content","product":"ai-guardrails","runs":"fc","why":"Block prompt injection and harmful payloads from untrusted input"}
{"t":"step","id":"classify","kind":"ai","label":"Classify ticket intent","task":"classify","ai":"qwen3.8-flash","runs":"fc","why":"Determine issue category to route remediation logic"}
{"t":"step","id":"retrieve","kind":"knowledge","label":"Search knowledge base","task":"retrieve","product":"dashvector","ai":"text-embedding-v4","runs":"fc","why":"Find relevant runbooks and known solutions"}
{"t":"step","id":"rank","kind":"knowledge","label":"Rerank results","task":"rerank","ai":"qwen3-rerank","runs":"fc","why":"Surface the most relevant KB articles for the agent"}
