{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain pattern: parse RFP, retrieve policy, draft answers, hallucination check, then SME approval before delivery."}
{"t":"assume","id":"rfp-source","text":"RFPs arrive as email attachments or uploads"}
{"t":"assume","id":"policy-store","text":"Approved policies are stored in a vector database"}
{"t":"assume","id":"sme-routing","text":"SME routing is based on extracted RFP topics"}
