{"t":"say","text":"Parallel fan-out prompt chain: translate per language, auto-score quality, escalate low-confidence segments to human translators."}
{"t":"assume","id":"doc-source","text":"Source documentation is English text stored in OSS"}
{"t":"assume","id":"six-langs","text":"Target languages: ES, FR, DE, JA, ZH, PT"}
