{"t":"say","text":"Prompt chain with an agent for theme clustering, guarded drafting, human PR approval, and posting negative review replies."}
{"t":"assume","id":"review-source","text":"Reviews arrive via webhook from the marketplace platform.","alt":"Reviews are polled periodically from a database."}
{"t":"ask","id":"volume","text":"How many marketplace reviews arrive per day?"}
