{"t":"done","summary":"EventBridge-triggered SRE agent with MCP tools for logs and metrics, drafting a rollback proposal gated by on-call approval."}

{"t":"say","text":"Single agent pattern: planner approval gates any expedite spending; PDF parsing and cost math use built-in tools."}
